          "type": "pieges",
          "items": [
            "<i>You like it?</i> sans auxiliaire → <i>**Do** you like it?</i>",
            "<i>Who did break it?</i> → <i>Who **broke** it?</i>",
            "<i>Where does he lives?</i> → <i>Where does he **live**?</i>",
            "Après <i>I wonder, Do you know</i> : plus d’inversion."
